<h2 class="fw-bold " style="color:#0747AE;">Introduction- The cell</h6>
<hr/>

                        <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark" style="font-size:18px; line-height:34px;">
                         The Placement Office is responsible for campus placement at Rajkiya Engineering College,Pratapgarh. The Placement-in- Charge, the Assistant Placement Officer, the Placement Office staff and the student representatives handle various crucial tasks in the office like reaching out to companies, scheduling & executing placement related activities and carrying out all official communication with recruiters and with students. The Training and Placement Office at RECP is dedicated to creating meaningful career opportunities for its students by serving as a vital link between academia and industry. With a mission to empower students through employment, the TPO is driven by a proactive team of Placement Managers, Company Coordinators, and Department Placement Coordinators. This team works collaboratively to connect with reputed recruiters, enhance student readiness, and uphold institutional values. Well-equipped with modern infrastructure and a student-first approach, the office is committed to facilitating a smooth, transparent, and result-oriented placement process that ensures our students step confidently into their professional journeys.

                        </p>
                       <h2 class="fw-bold" style="color:#0747AE;">Our Students</h2>
					   <p class="m-0 text-justify text-dark" style="font-size:18px; line-height:34px;"> At the heart of our Training and Placement Cell are our students bright, dedicated, and driven to excel. Our students come from diverse backgrounds and are trained not only in core technical skills but also in soft skills, problem-solving, and real-world application of knowledge. With strong academic foundations and hands-on experience through internships, projects, and industry interactions, they are well-prepared to meet the demands of today's dynamic work environment. Their commitment to learning and innovation makes them valuable assets to any organization.
</p>
